  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Knowledge is power V: Protection and Empowerment of Women, Girls and Children in Bekaa Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide a supportive and protective environment where women and adolescent girls are equipped with educational and vocational skills to increase their chances of employability, support their education and the education of their children alongside providing case management and psycho-social support through entertaining activities to relief some of the stressors they face on a daily basis while networking  with other women and adolescent girls who share the same interests.
This project targets women (18+) and adolescent girls (14-17) of both host and refugee communities, residing in central Bekaa, over the period of 9 months.</narrative>
  </description>
